{
 "note": "APPEND-ONLY successor: item-1 machinery, PART A (launcher + trainer side of the shared KD-on/KD-off comparative wrapper). Tests only; NO compute; NO benchmark; sealed data untouched. Implements the owner-directed STRICT enum MEDZEN_EXECUTION_MODE=plain|arm2_comparative (does NOT overload MEDZEN_TRAIN_MODE lora|full or MEDZEN_VARIANT ctc|llm). resolve_execution_mode/is_arm2_comparative in scripts/b5_sagemaker_job.py (fail-closed: unknown value refuses; plain+KD refuses; absent => KD-on is arm2_comparative, KD-off is plain \u2014 so the frozen calibration packet and all plain packets are byte-identical). The entrypoint fork + inject_launcher_provenance + validate_arm2_semantics now key off is_arm2_comparative: arm2_comparative ALWAYS runs pipeline.omniasr_calibrate and permits KD-on candidates + the KD-off control (KD recipe cross-checks are KD-on-only; acceptance_criteria + result_verifier are shared); plain training is unchanged. pipeline/omniasr_train.py parse_config resolves the same enum (parity-tested) and binds execution_mode into TrainerConfig -> fingerprint_payload -> the run fingerprint, so a resume CANNOT switch mode. pipeline/omniasr_calibrate.py refuses unless execution_mode==arm2_comparative. Regressions (tests/test_arm2_execution_mode.py, 8): the fail-closed enum matrix; launcher/trainer resolver PARITY; mode-in-fingerprint; injection fires for the KD-off control; and PROOF that every committed plain-training packet routes to the bare trainer with NO injection and an unchanged Environment, while the frozen Arm-2 calibration packet still routes to the wrapper with its committed canonical sha 3c5024ed unchanged. Full suite 2497 passed (this evidence rebind resolves the head test). REMAINING (item 1 PART B + item 2): the verifier KD-conditional branch (so a KD-off control PASSES verification \u2014 kd_positive_finite_steps/kd_coverage become KD-on-only, shared checks apply to both) and the nomination-split minting + overlap/leakage proof, then the benchmark execution packet + scanned image digest -> the PAUSE deliverable. HELD: the six 2000-step runs, sealed evaluation, promotion, deployment; only the single capped $0.80 benchmark is approved and it is NOT run yet.",
